  "description": "Muqodimah is a powerful Arabic-style display font inspired by vintage calligraphy, Old English lettering, and decorative Gothic aesthetics.\nDesigned to evoke a sense of heritage, spirituality, and historical depth, this typeface delivers bold character with an artistic and ornamental presence.\nWith its sharp contrasts, dramatic strokes, and calligraphic rhythm, Muqodimah blends Arabic visual culture with classic gothic structure, creating a unique typographic voice that feels sacred, timeless, and authoritative. This font is ideal for expressive headlines where tradition meets artistic boldness.\nMuqodimah is not intended for body text but shines as a statement font for titles, posters, book covers, and cultural or religious-themed designs. It offers a distinctive fusion of Arabic aesthetics and Gothic typography, perfect for designers seeking a font that conveys tradition, strength, and artistic depth. Its decorative nature makes every design feel intentional, expressive, and culturally rich.\nPerfect for:* Islamic & Arabic-themed designs* Religious posters & Ramadan projects* Book covers & historical titles* Decorative headlines* Heritage branding* Artistic typography compositions.\nWith PUA encoding included, all special characters and decorative elements are easily accessible without additional software.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Muqodimah is a powerful Arabic-style display font inspired by vintage calligraphy, Old English lettering, and decorative Gothic aesthetics.</strong></p>\n<p>Designed to evoke a sense of heritage, spirituality, and historical depth, this typeface delivers bold character with an artistic and ornamental presence.</p>\n<p>With its sharp contrasts, dramatic strokes, and calligraphic rhythm, Muqodimah blends Arabic visual culture with classic gothic structure, creating a unique typographic voice that feels sacred, timeless, and authoritative. This font is ideal for expressive headlines where tradition meets artistic boldness.</p>\n<p>Muqodimah is not intended for body text but shines as a statement font for titles, posters, book covers, and cultural or religious-themed designs. It offers a distinctive fusion of Arabic aesthetics and Gothic typography, perfect for designers seeking a font that conveys tradition, strength, and artistic depth. Its decorative nature makes every design feel intentional, expressive, and culturally rich.</p>\n<p><strong>Perfect for:</strong><br>* Islamic &amp; Arabic-themed designs<br>* Religious posters &amp; Ramadan projects<br>* Book covers &amp; historical titles<br>* Decorative headlines<br>* Heritage branding<br>* Artistic typography compositions.</p>\n<p><strong>With PUA encoding included, all special characters and decorative elements are easily accessible without additional software.</strong></p>",
